      ],
      "source": "https://eastpetehistory.org/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The society’s museum sits in the historic East Petersburg Train Station, a 1902 brick building that once ferried passengers across Pennsylvania.",
